+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| SYSTEM
| @{system pixel_vault "Pixel Vault"}
| TYPES
| @{type Tile}
| COMPONENTS
| @{component camera}
| @{port camera.tile out: Tile public}
| @{component vault}
| @{port vault.tile in: Tile public}
| RELATIONS
| @{data stash camera.tile -> vault.tile mode=copy}
| INVARIANTS
| @{invariant i_type type_equal(camera.tile, vault.tile)}
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
